cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this diagnostic protocol or the accompanying traces, please cite both the paper and this archived release.
title: "Auditable diagnostic protocol for tiny-object label assignment"
abstract: >-
  Read-only instrumentation of a task-aligned assigner, per-ground-truth traces of
  the four assignment stages, a static-proxy audit, a 2x2 weight/similarity design,
  and the analysis scripts that regenerate every table and figure of the paper.
